    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight per-component network metric aggregator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All counters are atomic and updated with relaxed memory order (suitable for monotonic counters where strict ordering is not required). Call <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1network_1_1_network_metrics_1a02876a08cc4bac9866127231aebcc460" kindref="member">snapshot()</ref></computeroutput> to obtain a consistent read (acquires all atomics). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
